    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>依公告規定繳交</div>\n<translater-content-app data-wxt-shadow-root=\"\"></translater-content-app>",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1.\t準時上課並尊重師生互動。\n2.\t出席率將影響期末成績。\n3.\t課堂中需積極參與討論與活動。\n4.\t作業須於指定時間繳交，逾期酌扣分數。\nClassroom Regulations\n1.\tStudents are expected to arrive on time and show respect in teacher–student interactions.\n2.\tAttendance will affect the final grade.\n3.\tActive participation in class discussions and activities is required.\n4.\tAssignments must be submitted on time; late submissions will result in grade deductions.",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>\n<div>本課程強調學術誠信，嚴禁抄襲、代寫或未經授權之使用。所有報告與設計成果必須為學生原創，引用資料需標明出處。違反者將依校規處理，並影響學期成績。</div>\n\n<div>This course emphasizes academic integrity. Plagiarism, ghostwriting, or unauthorized use of materials is strictly prohibited. All reports and design works must be the student&rsquo;s original creation, and all references must be properly cited. Any violation will be handled in accordance with university regulations and will affect the final grade.</div>\n</div>\n<translater-content-app data-wxt-shadow-root=\"\"></translater-content-app>",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
